- MegaBasterd — GUI-only Java app; MEGA protocol is built-in; megatools/MEGAcmd remain optional fallback.
- yt-dlp sources / extractors — only lazy-registry, networking, fragment, and
  PP/outtmpl *architecture* ideas are mirrored under Unlicense terms; do not
  vendor yt-dlp modules.
- yt-dlp DRM／encrypted-stream handling — udl refuses encrypted manifests.
